  "description": "RTDB rules production verdicts for corpus scenario \"r37-runtime-comparison-and-length-types\" (rtdb#71). Captured by deploy-observe-restore (RTDB has no server-side rules test API). addition, relational comparisons (<, >, >=), and .length on runtime values of the wrong type must match production rather than coercing booleans/strings/objects or reading a child key named \"length\".",
